instructions:
In package.json, at the text `"scripts": {
    "test": "node --test"
  }`: Add a `bin` entry mapping the command name `todo` to the executable `src/todo.js`, and replace the `test` script value `node --test` with `node --test test/` so `npm test` discovers every file in the project's `test/` directory (the existing greeting test plus the new store, todo-format, todo, package and readme tests). Keep the file's 2-space indentation and trailing newline.
